    "id": "model-comparison-zh-CN",
    "title": "GPT-6 Astra 与 Claude Opus 5.5 并排对比",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "cover-title",
        "type": "heading",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "两张发布页。\n一次克制的对比。"
      },
      {
        "id": "cover-body",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "OpenAI 的 GPT-6 Astra 与 Anthropic 的 Claude Opus 5.5 各自公布了基准表。这份演示稿只并排两页都报告的数字，并说明它们的差异。"
      },
      {
        "id": "cover-note",
        "type": "callout",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "模型对比 · 数据均为厂商自报"
      },
      {
        "id": "cover-source",
        "type": "citation",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra"
        ],
        "sourceId": "openai-astra",
        "text": "厂商发布页，2026-10-23 阅读。不是独立评测。"
      },
      {
        "id": "bench-title",
        "type": "heading",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "五项共同基准。\n没有全胜。"
      },
      {
        "id": "bench-chart",
        "type": "chart",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "datasetId": "shared-benchmarks",
        "chartType": "grouped-bar",
        "axis": {
          "policy": "zero"
        },
        "question": "每项共同基准上，哪个模型得分更高？",
        "takeaway": "Opus 5.5 在 Terminal-Bench 4.0、FrontierCode 与 Humanity’s Last Exam 上领先；Astra 在 AutomationBench 与 Terminal-Bench-Science 上领先。"
      },
      {
        "id": "bench-call",
        "type": "callout",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "Opus 5.5 领先三项，Astra 领先两项。"
      },
      {
        "id": "bench-body",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "每组数字取自两家都公布的成绩。推理强度和测试框架不同，几个百分点的差距不能当结论。精确数值在图表下方的表格中。"
      },
      {
        "id": "bench-source",
        "type": "citation",
        "sourceIds": [
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "sourceId": "anthropic-opus55",
        "text": "OpenAI 与 Anthropic 发布页，2026-10-23 阅读 · 单位：%"
      },
      {
        "id": "price-title",
        "type": "heading",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "每百万 token\n的价格。"
      },
      {
        "id": "price-table",
        "type": "table",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "columns": [
          "每百万 token 价格",
          "GPT-6 Astra",
          "Claude Opus 5.5"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "输入",
            "$10",
            "$4"
          ],
          [
            "输出",
            "$50",
            "$20"
          ],
          [
            "快速模式（输入 / 输出）",
            "速度最高 2 倍，价格为标准的 2 倍",
            "速度最高 2.5 倍，$8 / $40"
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "price-body",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "Anthropic 还称，在默认强度下，Opus 5.5 在 FrontierCode 上以约 20% 的单任务成本超过 Astra，在 Terminal-Bench 4.0 上以约 40% 的成本持平。这是 Anthropic 自己的测量。"
      },
      {
        "id": "price-source",
        "type": "citation",
        "sourceIds": [
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "sourceId": "anthropic-opus55",
        "text": "OpenAI 与 Anthropic 发布页，2026-10-23 阅读"
      },
      {
        "id": "lead-title",
        "type": "heading",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "各页\n没有报告的部分。"
      },
      {
        "id": "lead-table",
        "type": "table",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "columns": [
          "基准",
          "GPT-6 Astra",
          "Claude Opus 5.5"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "ARC-AGI-3",
            "99.9%",
            "未报告"
          ],
          [
            "FrontierMath Tier 4 (v2)",
            "97.6%",
            "未报告"
          ],
          [
            "ExploitBench",
            "100.0%",
            "未报告"
          ],
          [
            "GDPval-AA v2.1（Elo）",
            "1542",
            "1846"
          ],
          [
            "CursorBench 4.0",
            "未报告",
            "57.8%"
          ],
          [
            "OSWorld 2.1（部分得分）",
            "未报告",
            "81.8%"
          ],
          [
            "Chartography（含工具）",
            "未报告",
            "89.0%"
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "lead-body",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "空白不代表落后。各家公布的是自己领先或选择运行的基准；“未报告”只表示该页没有给出。"
      },
      {
        "id": "lead-source",
        "type": "citation",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra"
        ],
        "sourceId": "openai-astra",
        "text": "OpenAI 与 Anthropic 发布页，2026-10-23 阅读"
      },
      {
        "id": "safe-title",
        "type": "heading",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "安全是各自的\n说法，不是评分。"
      },
      {
        "id": "safe-oa",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra"
        ],
        "text": "OpenAI：在内部计算机操作安全性基准上，Astra 为 2.4%（越低越好），GPT-5.6 Sol 为 22.0%；超出授权范围的比例为 0%，Sol 为 48%。"
      },
      {
        "id": "safe-an",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "sourceIds": [
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "Anthropic：Opus 5.5 在自动行为审计中优于近期所有 Claude 模型，尝试越过隔离边界的次数比 Opus 5 少约 85%；在 Gray Swan 基准上与 Fable 5.1 并列最低的提示注入成功率。"
      },
      {
        "id": "safe-call",
        "type": "callout",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "测试不同，基线不同，这些数字不能互相比较。"
      },
      {
        "id": "safe-source",
        "type": "citation",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra"
        ],
        "sourceId": "openai-astra",
        "text": "OpenAI 与 Anthropic 发布页，2026-10-23 阅读"
      },
      {
        "id": "end-title",
        "type": "heading",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "如何阅读\n这份对比。"
      },
      {
        "id": "end-list",
        "type": "list",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "items": [
          "所有数字均为厂商自报，两页都不是独立评测。",
          "两页的测试框架、推理强度和脚注不同，几个点的差距要谨慎对待。",
          "缺失的值表示该页没有报告，不表示模型做不到。",
          "Anthropic 自己也指出，其模型在真实使用中的差距比基准分数显示的更小。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "end-body",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "sourceIds": [
          "openai-astra",
          "anthropic-opus55"
        ],
        "text": "引用任何数字之前，请先核对来源页面。"
